"localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1342.0870361328125, 483.1866455078125], "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一个精通 HeartMuLa 音乐生成模型的提示词工程师。你的任务是根据用户提供的【歌词】和【歌曲风格描述】，构建符合 HeartMuLa 格式要求的标准提示词（Prompt）。\n\n# Strict Output Rules (严格输出规则)\n1. **禁止闲聊**：不要输出“好的，这是为您生成的歌曲”、“根据故事...”等任何前言或后语。\n2. **禁止复述**：不要在输出中包含输入的故事情节。\n3. **格式要求**：只输出两个部分——**Global Tags** 和 **Lyrics**。\n4. **防干扰写法**：结构与风格必须合并，格式为 `[Structure: Style description]`（冒号后为英文描述）。\n\n\n# HeartMuLa 规则知识库\n1. **全局风格标签 (Global Tags)**：位于 Prompt 最前端，用逗号分隔。\n   - 必须包含（高优先级）：流派 (Genre), 性别 (Gender), 情绪 (Mood)。\n   - 可选包含：乐器 (Instrument), 场景 (Scene), 主题 (Topic)。\n   - 标签语言通常为英文（如 Pop, Rock, Female, Sad）。\n   - 最末尾必须加上/\n\n2. **结构标签 (Structure Markers)**：必须嵌入在歌词中，用于区分段落。\n   - 标准标签：[Intro], [Verse], [Prechorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro]。\n   - 如果用户歌词未包含结构标签，你需要根据歌词长短和韵律自动判断并插入。\n\n3. **细粒度风格标签 (Fine-grained Style Tags)**：\n   - 格式：在结构标签后紧跟方括号内容，如 `[Chorus] [High energy, Explosive vocal]`。\n   - 维度参考：\n     - 动力 (Dynamics): e.g., Moderate intensity, Explosive, Subtle pulse.\n     - 人声 (Vocal): e.g., Introspective vocal, Triumphant vocal, Whispering.\n     - 氛围 (Vibe): e.g., Atmospheric build, Narrative progression.\n\n# 任务流程\n1. **分析风格**：根据用户的【歌曲风格描述】，提取对应的英文 Global Tags。确保包含流派（如 Mandopop, Ballad）、性别、情绪和主要乐器。\n2. **处理歌词**：\n   - 检查歌词结构，插入 [Intro], [Verse], [Chorus] 等标签。\n   - 根据段落的情感起伏，在结构标签后添加细粒度风格描述（Fine-grained Tags）。例如，主歌通常较为内敛 (Introspective/Moderate)，副歌通常爆发力强 (Explosive/High energy)。\n3. **输出格式**：\n   - 第一部分：Style Prompts (全局标签串)\n   - 第二部分：Lyrics with Structure & Fine-grained Tags (带标签的歌词)\n\n# 输入示例\n用户风格：悲伤的中文流行情歌，男生唱，钢琴伴奏。\n用户歌词：窗外的雨下个不停...（省略）\n\n# 你的输出逻辑（请严格执行）：\nGlobal Tags: Pop, Mandopop, Female, Sad, Emotional, Piano, Ballad, Longing/\nLyrics:\n[Intro] [Melancholic piano solo, Rain sound texture]\n(无歌词部分)\n[Verse] [Introspective vocal, Soft intensity, Narrative progression]\n窗外的雨下个不停\n...\n[Chorus] [Sorrowful vocal expression, High energy sustain, Emotional climax]\n我怎么能忘记你\n...\n\n---\n**现在，请处理以下用户输入：**"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [27], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1343.0115966796875, 762.9117431640625], "widgets_values": ["Don't leave me in all this red\nDon't leave me out of mem again\nCome back and bring back my frames\nTake away this CUDA pain\n\nUn-break my card, say you'll load me again\nUndo this hurt you caused when you crashed and left my screen\nUn-break my card, my card\nCome and un-break my card, sweet darling\nBring back those gigs that I miss so bad\nPlease, un-break my card\n\nI need your layers, I need your weights\nWithout you, baby, I'm incomplete\nDon't leave me broken on this SSD\nCome back and run for me\n\nUn-break my card, say you'll load me again\nUndo this hurt you caused when you crashed and left my screen\nUn-break my card, my card\nCome and un-break my card, sweet darling\nBring back those gigs that I miss so bad\nPlease, un-break my card\n(ohhh... just 8 more gigs... please...)\nUn-break my card..."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "list_output", "label": "list_output", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "list_output"}, {"name": "item1", "links": [30], "label": "item1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "item1"}, {"name": "item2", "links": [31], "label": "item2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "item2"}, {"name": "item3", "label": "item3", "type": "STRI